.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt PIGLIT 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm piglit
.Nd run graphics conformance tests
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
runs the Piglit graphics tests and produces result summaries.
.Pp
.Dl piglit run quick RESULTS
.Dl piglit summary console RESULTS
.Pp
The desktop layer supplies the Debian test data and Python modules.
Use a new result directory for each run and record the renderer, driver and case list.
The graphics runners set the concurrency and select the cases for a checkpoint or release.
